{"study_accession":"PRJNA770502","secondary_study_accession":"SRP341728","title":"Exosomal Long noncoding RNA MAGI2-AS3 and CCDC144NL-AS1 possibly promote oral squamous cell carcinoma development via PI3K-AKT-mTOR signal pathway","description":"The lncRNA expression profiles were examined derived from serum exosomes (SEs) from patients with oral squamous cell carcinoma (OSCC) with lymph node metastasis (OSCC-LNM), OSCC with no LNM (OSCC-NLNM), oral leukoplakia (OL), postoperative metastasis and recurrence OSCC (PMPMROSCC) and healthy controls (HCs). Bioinformatics analysis was used to analyse differentially expressed lncRNAs (DE lncRNAs) and a total of 150 subjects were enrolled for RT-PCR verifications. The correlations of four lncRNAs and clinicopathologic factors, biochemical indexes were evaluated. MAGI2-AS3 and CCDC144NL-AS1 were overexpressed or silenced in oral cancer (OC) cells. The proliferation, invasion, and migration were evaluated to investigate the effect of MAGI2-AS3 and CCDC144NL-AS1 on the development of OSCC. The related proteins of PI3K-AKT-mTOR signal pathway were also detected.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":12,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN22218866","study_accession":"PRJNA770502","blood_class":"plasma_serum_cfrna","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","sex":"male","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-10-18","attributes":[["isolate","healthy person blood"],["age","45"],["biomaterial_provider","the Affiliated Stomatology Hospital of Guangxi Medical University"],["sex","male"],["tissue","plasma"],["replicate","biological replicate 1"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR16372005","experiment_accession":"SRX12649452","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"RT-PCR","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":54569101,"base_count":14975296264,"first_public":"2021-10-18","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 s